              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ദേഷ്യപ്പെട്ടു, dēṣyappeṭṭu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ദേഷ്യം anger + പെടുക, the verb that turns a feeling into something that happens to you. The person you are angry with takes -ഓട്."
            }
